# Testing Rules

## Unit Tests (core module)
- JUnit 5 + AEM/Sling Mocks (io.wcm.testing.mock.aem / org.apache.sling.testing)
- Mock repositories when testing services
- State machine: cover ALL valid transitions + representative invalid ones

## Integration Tests (it.tests module) — REQUIRED by exercise
- Prove state-machine rules end-to-end:
    - Every valid transition succeeds
    - Invalid transitions are rejected (HTTP 409)
- Test create/list/view/update/comment/search happy paths

## Conventions
- Behavior-named tests: shouldAllowOpenToInProgress(), shouldRejectClosedToOpen()
- Arrange-Act-Assert structure
- No test depends on another test's state
